    <s:String x:Key="Loc_Editor_SpecialFolders">Windows places</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Loc_Editor_FolderHint">The panel shows what is in the folder every time it opens, so it is always up to date. Folders inside it open next to the panel, like a submenu. Windows places are the ones that are no folder on disk, like the Control Panel or This PC. You can also drop a folder here.</s:String>
